Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[nervous panting]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[panicked grunting]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[tense music plays]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[knocking at door]{\i0}\N{\i1}-[gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good morning, miss.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[yawns]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:00:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rose.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.07,0:01:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has my mother yet awakened?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did not overindulge.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Truly, it was just a poor night of sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall fetch a glass{\i0}\N{\i1}of raw eggs and garlic, ma'am.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.33,0:01:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should be just the thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Violet sighs]{\i0}\N{\i1}Are you feeling better, dearest?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps I, too, caught whatever it was{\i0}\N{\i1}that sent you home early from the party.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.59,0:01:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have a terrible headache, indeed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[exhales sharply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.18,0:01:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am engaged.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh! [chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, that is wonderful news.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, you will be a princess.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.86,0:01:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-No.{\i0}\N{\i1}-No?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I will not.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mama, I am engaged to the duke.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The duke asked for my hand,{\i0}\N{\i1}and I accepted.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You do not seem pleased.{\i0}\N{\i1}Whatever is wrong?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no. No-- Nothing is wrong.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It simply happened so quickly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've not had a moment to take it in.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I am overjoyed, Mama, truly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course you are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are to be a duchess!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, darling! [laughs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.48,0:02:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I knew there was something between you…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ruse or not!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.77,0:02:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, tell me. Tell me everything!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.69,0:02:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How do you feel?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-So in love.{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Violet laughs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm unsure how I can be expected{\i0}\N{\i1}to wait an entire month to marry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.49,0:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could we not obtain a special license{\i0}\N{\i1}to marry this week?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.58,0:02:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do not wish to lie to you…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-But the duke and I--{\i0}\N{\i1}-You do not need to tell me anything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whatever happened{\i0}\N{\i1}between the two of you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it is all right. [chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.35,0:03:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know good society{\i0}\N{\i1}makes quite a fuss about such things…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but when it comes to love,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}such things happen{\i0}\N{\i1}more frequently than one might expect.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even your father and I, we had trouble{\i0}\N{\i1}controlling our passions as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Wilson] Your drink, ma'am.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.53,0:03:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will not be necessary, Wilson.{\i0}\N{\i1}I am feeling much improved.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have a wedding to plan in three days.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My darling girl,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you are getting what you always wanted.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are marrying for love.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[theme music plays]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.59,0:03:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Violet chuckles lightly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Lady Whistledown]{\i0}\N<span style="style2">{\an8}One may say modesty is a virtue,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}yet this author{\i0}\N{\i1}is hardly a virtuous woman.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.14,0:03:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}It is therefore my great pleasure{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to announce the news others questioned,{\i0}\N{\i1}but I never doubted.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.65,0:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will be{\i0}\N{\i1}the grandest wedding of the year.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tulips enough to fill the great room{\i0}\N{\i1}and the finest silks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only the best{\i0}\N{\i1}for Miss Bridgerton and my nephew.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The latest Whistledown?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How does she report my triumph?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[moans nervously]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Lady Whistledown] {\i0}<span style="style2">The diamond{\i0}\N<span style="style2">of the season has made her match,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.96,0:04:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}officially betrothed{\i0}\N{\i1}to the Duke of Hastings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has something happened?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bride, undoubtedly,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is giddy with anticipation{\i0}\N{\i1}over the impending nuptials…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall need fittings for the dress{\i0}\N{\i1}and my trousseau.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[Rose grunts]{\i0}\N{\i1}-And, oh…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.85,0:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-I am forgetting something, surely.{\i0}\N{\i1}-I shall take care of everything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just think, you shall be the duchess {\i0}\N{\i1}by Saturday. [chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}…an event that will apparently take place{\i0}\N{\i1}sooner rather than later.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[horses neighing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, there are only two reasons{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to procure a special license{\i0}\N{\i1}and race to the altar:{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}true love,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or concealing a scandal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How does it feel, sister, to be in love?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.38,0:04:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Imagine leaping off a cliff{\i0}\N{\i1}and shattering on the ground.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A fair analogy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:04:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am afraid I cannot find{\i0}\N{\i1}the words, dear Hyacinth.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.64,0:05:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though, Eloise, I believe{\i0}\N{\i1}you will know what love feels like{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}soon enough next season.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You think I am{\i0}\N{\i1}to follow in your footsteps?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.35,0:05:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can there be a more dreadful fate?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You do know that I am setting{\i0}\N{\i1}the standard for your future matches, yes?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should be grateful.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only thing I am grateful for{\i0}\N{\i1}is that I am not you, nor will I ever be.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Daphne, His Royal Highness{\i0}\N{\i1}Prince Friedrich is here for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-I am sorry.{\i0}\N{\i1}-You have nothing to be sorry for.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No… No promises were made.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.96,0:05:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Although,{\i0}\N{\i1}I thought we shared an understanding{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.13,0:05:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with our discussions of the future.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But, uh…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the fault is mine for misreading{\i0}\N{\i1}your polite attentions as something more.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. You did not misread me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then why…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This engagement is{\i0}\N{\i1}of your own free will, is it not?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[Daphne chuckles] {\i0}\N{\i1}-If the duke is forcing your hand--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Forcing me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My goodness!{\i0}\N{\i1}If anything, I am the one forcing him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I mean to say{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:06:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is that love is surely{\i0}\N{\i1}the greatest force of all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Once the duke and I realized{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we were completely enamored{\i0}\N{\i1}with each other,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nothing could stand between us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not even, I'm sorry to say,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.25,0:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the attentions of a good{\i0}\N{\i1}and kind man such as yourself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I can only wish you a lifetime{\i0}\N{\i1}of contentment with your new husband.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a pleasure to know you,{\i0}\N{\i1}Miss Bridgerton.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[door creaking]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hyacinth!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could not help it, sister.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though, I must say,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I certainly hope the duke's proposal{\i0}\N{\i1}was at least half as romantic as that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.47,0:07:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Did we not say ten o'clock?{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Daphne grunts lightly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.35,0:07:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We did.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There he is.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, do not make haste on our account.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A most heartfelt congratulations,{\i0}\N{\i1}Your Grace.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I look forward{\i0}\N{\i1}to counting you as part of our family.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-As do I.{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Violet chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you bring the bar with you, boy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps we should promenade?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Simon clears throat]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sniffs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.47,0:07:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[Daphne] Have you--{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Simon] I should--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.18,0:07:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Simon grunts]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles] I was…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was going to ask if you had tried{\i0}\N{\i1}drinking raw eggs and garlic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hear it works wonders to rid yourself{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}of the lingering effects of…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-What were you going to say?{\i0}\N{\i1}-What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before, you started to say something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.66,0:08:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, I-- I do not recall.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simon, look at me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, if it isn't the most {\i0}\N{\i1}talked-about couple in the ton.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Such a perfect-looking pair.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Indeed. The two of you{\i0}\N{\i1}will make a fine family, I am sure of it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.85,0:08:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-We are so happy.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Very much so.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Lord Wetherby] Hmm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember that feeling,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the nerves of new love.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Or something like it.{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Violet chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Madame Delacroix, good day. May I--{\i0}\N{\i1}-She is not here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.01,0:09:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only beg a moment of her time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She does not owe me her time, I know that.{\i0}\N{\i1}She does not owe me anything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.27,0:09:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I wish to provide for her regardless,{\i0}\N{\i1}as I promised.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She will be taken care of.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Will you tell her?{\i0}\N{\i1}-You are too late. Siena's gone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gone?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You mean, she's left town?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Indeed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As it transpires, my lord,{\i0}\N{\i1}she does not need your money,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nor anything else from you,{\i0}\N{\i1}for that matter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Tell me where she is?{\i0}\N{\i1}-Leave the young lady alone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have you not done enough?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[clears throat]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It seems Mrs. Varley had some trouble{\i0}\N{\i1}at the modiste this morning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Madame Delacroix is refusing{\i0}\N{\i1}to give her any of the dresses{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}until the last few months' bills are paid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The young ladies have plenty of dresses.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps it is possible{\i0}\N{\i1}for them to wear them all again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And perhaps it is possible for you{\i0}\N{\i1}to do without your tobacco as well!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Colin Bridgerton for Miss Thompson.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.09,0:10:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, Mr. Bridgerton, these are beautiful.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.47,0:10:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I applaud you, Miss Thompson.{\i0}\N{\i1}I bring you flowers on each of my visits,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.93,0:10:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and yet you react{\i0}\N{\i1}with admirable surprise every time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall need{\i0}\N{\i1}to bring you something unexpected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-A bushel of tomatoes, perhaps.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Oh! [laughs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Marina hates tomatoes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.65,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is untrue.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love tomatoes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Colin, you know where I have heard{\i0}\N{\i1}you can get excellent tomatoes?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Greece.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps you could{\i0}\N{\i1}bring back a tomato plant{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for Miss Thompson as a souvenir{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.49,0:10:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}when you return{\i0}\N{\i1}from your travels this year.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am uncertain of my travels{\i0}\N{\i1}at the moment, Pen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-But you were so keen to travel.{\i0}\N{\i1}-It is true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But, were I to go,{\i0}\N{\i1}there may be things in London{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should miss even more{\i0}\N{\i1}than seeing the world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Some tea, Mr. Bridgerton?{\i0}\N{\i1}-That would be lovely.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mama?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Do you think this is wise?{\i0}\N{\i1}-Whatever do you mean?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Colin is young,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}years from seriously thinking{\i0}\N{\i1}about marriage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would hate to think{\i0}\N{\i1}Marina is simply wasting her time,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}time she simply does not have, of course.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[kitchen staff clamoring]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your mistress will not know{\i0}\N{\i1}the household staff{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}at the duke's country home,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so it will be your business{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to attend to her needs{\i0}\N{\i1}and ease her arrival.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her happiness is your greatest concern.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, no, no!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The icing must be as white as lilies.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a proper family.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A shipment of fine sugar went down at sea.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:12:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no more in London,{\i0}\N{\i1}for love nor money.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does Miss Daphne wish{\i0}\N{\i1}for roses or lilacs for the ceremony?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uh…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does your mistress wish the cake{\i0}\N{\i1}to be soaked in rum or brandy?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will it be tongue{\i0}\N{\i1}or ham with eggs for the reception?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am not sure. I shall ask.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rose, you are{\i0}\N{\i1}the future duchess's lady's maid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You must know these things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Genevieve] Your wedding gown{\i0}\N{\i1}is a long way from being finished,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Bridgerton.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I promise you will not be disappointed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She will need a new pelisse too,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then the more intimate items.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Four nightdresses, perhaps? Or five?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What could I possibly need{\i0}\N{\i1}with five new nightdresses?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They are not for you, {\i0}<span style="style2">ma chère{\i0}{\i1},{\i0}\N{\i1}but for your {\i0}<span style="style2">amoureux{\i0}{\i1}.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What else do you think a honeymoon is for?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will be a most special time, dear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[shop door closes]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, five. Five nightdresses{\i0}\N{\i1}will do nicely. [chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.45,0:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Daphne!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.36,0:12:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How lovely to see you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, I do hope{\i0}\N{\i1}your wedding dress will be ready in time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Madam Delacroix must be working so fast.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mama, might you spare me a moment?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must have Cressida's opinion{\i0}\N{\i1}on some fabric.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her taste is impeccable.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, dear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am to have a new pelisse{\i0}\N{\i1}for my honeymoon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.43,0:13:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What about this color?{\i0}\N{\i1}Trimmed with fur, perhaps.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fur, at this time of year?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, I suppose it depends {\i0}\N{\i1}on how much time{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you and the duke spend outdoors.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But you are fond{\i0}\N{\i1}of a midnight garden stroll, I believe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do not know what you mean.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.69,0:13:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am almost certain I saw the two of you{\i0}\N{\i1}in the gardens at the Trowbridge ball.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No chaperone in sight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How strange.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do not recall leaving the ballroom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Cressida] Hmm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though I dare say{\i0}\N{\i1}it would have been difficult{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to see the gardens{\i0}\N{\i1}with any real clarity at night,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}unless you were actually{\i0}\N{\i1}out in them yourself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My view of the garden was perfectly clear{\i0}\N{\i1}from the safety of the terrace, Daphne.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You dallied with the prince{\i0}\N{\i1}purely to rouse the duke's jealousy,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then you lured him into those gardens{\i0}\N{\i1}to trap him into marriage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never would have imagined{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that a Bridgerton{\i0}\N{\i1}would ever come to know such shame.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.19,0:14:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should consider{\i0}\N{\i1}your words more carefully, Cressida.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In a matter of days, I am to be a duchess,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you shall be just as you are now,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}unmarried and untitled.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.58,0:14:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So you can either be{\i0}\N{\i1}a duchess's friend or her enemy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is entirely up to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[scoffs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First, let us see if you actually manage{\i0}\N{\i1}to drag him down that aisle at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.88,0:14:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would imagine{\i0}\N{\i1}a man like the duke does not take kindly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to being forced into anything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.14,0:14:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[tense music plays]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.43,0:14:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[nervous breathing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}["Beethoven's 5th Symphony" plays]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Prince Friedrich]{\i0}\N{\i1}I bid you farewell, {\i0}<span style="style2">Tante.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall be returning{\i0}\N{\i1}to Prussia this afternoon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I to believe you truly long{\i0}\N{\i1}for sweet pickles and sauerkraut?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fight for the girl!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hastings is merely a duke.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are a prince.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have no interest in brandishing my title{\i0}\N{\i1}before the young lady, nor do I need to.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.64,0:15:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am happy for them.{\i0}\N{\i1}Everyone is happy for them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have read{\i0}\N{\i1}of what your dear Whistledown writes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do you want?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.39,0:15:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-It is the king, Your Majesty.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Dead?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lucid.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[exasperated sigh]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Auf Wiedersehen, {\i0}<span style="style1">if you must go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While you may be content to accept defeat…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it is certainly not how I approach things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[church bells ringing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Simon] Apologies for my tardiness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The archbishop is yet to arrive.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[church bells continue]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-We should discuss Daphne's dowry.{\i0}\N{\i1}-There is nothing to discuss.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-I will not accept one.{\i0}\N{\i1}-I beg your pardon?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need not be paid to marry Daphne.{\i0}\N{\i1}It is an insulting custom in my judgment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You may place the money in trust for her,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but you need not harbor any doubts{\i0}\N{\i1}of my intention to support your sister.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her well-being is my responsibility now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I take that duty{\i0}\N{\i1}with the utmost seriousness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must apologize for, uh…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}well…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Shooting at me?{\i0}\N{\i1}-Indeed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Simon chuckles lightly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would have thought you dishonorable{\i0}\N{\i1}had you not.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.51,0:16:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides,{\i0}\N{\i1}you have always been a terrible shot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'd have stood{\i0}\N{\i1}a greater chance of wounding me{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if you had simply fired{\i0}\N{\i1}straight up in the air.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.35,0:16:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles] Your Grace.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.60,0:16:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}May I express my gratitude{\i0}\N{\i1}for your granting of this special license?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps, my lord, you should not.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.57,0:17:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Denied?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What on earth for?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The archbishop of Canterbury{\i0}\N{\i1}did not think he owed me an explanation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we are to wait weeks for this wedding,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it gives Cressida Cowper,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}not to mention Whistledown{\i0}\N{\i1}and anyone else,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.66,0:17:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}far too much time to uncover{\i0}\N{\i1}the truth of what happened in that garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simon--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.96,0:17:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Danbury.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome! Is everyone as famished as I?{\i0}\N{\i1}[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, this is far too grim a mood{\i0}\N{\i1}for the celebration I was counting on.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.85,0:17:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-What on earth is the matter?{\i0}\N{\i1}-Anthony?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have been denied our request{\i0}\N{\i1}for a special license.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-What?{\i0}\N{\i1}-The archbishop did not see a need.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Violet inhales sharply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is not the archbishop.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is the queen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps she has taken{\i0}\N{\i1}your rejection of her nephew to heart,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.33,0:17:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or perhaps she is simply bored.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Either way, it does not bode well{\i0}\N{\i1}for your daughter's social future,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nor any of the Bridgertons,{\i0}\N{\i1}for that matter.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Surely we must be able to do something?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Give her what she wants.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Attention.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Appear before her yourselves{\i0}\N{\i1}and make a personal appeal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But she will not respond to begging,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and she can sniff out even{\i0}\N{\i1}the faintest whiff of insincerity,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.77,0:18:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so do not lay it on thick.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tell her you are in love,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}plain and simple and true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can do that, can you not?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Now, where is the dinner I was promised?{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Violet chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[muffled revelry]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Bridgerton! I am so glad you came.{\i0}\N{\i1}-I dare not miss it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please, come in.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Make yourself at home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would show you around,{\i0}\N{\i1}but host duty calls.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Benedict chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[guests clamoring]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.31,0:19:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Genevieve] What are you doing here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apologies. Have we met?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.36,0:19:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We do not need to have met.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are a Bridgerton, yes?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see my reputation precedes me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[ironic chuckle] Not exactly a virtue.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anything that gets me your attention{\i0}\N{\i1}is a good thing, I rather think.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should go,{\i0}\N{\i1}home to your brother, perhaps.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.91,0:20:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckling scoff]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm receiving{\i0}\N{\i1}far too warm a welcome here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.59,0:20:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[clamoring continues]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.55,0:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Benedict panting]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[both grunting, moaning]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Genevieve whispering] Bridgerton.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[all panting]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.80,0:20:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[raucous clamoring]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.85,0:21:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Simon singing indistinctly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Will interrupts] {\i0}\N{\i1}Is that how the tune goes?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a bloody love song, I think.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Happy to hear you're embracing the genre.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.74,0:21:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where is my drink?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.61,0:21:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did they kick you out?{\i0}\N{\i1}My God, they kicked you out--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will marrying the girl truly be so bad?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know you care for her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feelings are irrelevant. {\i0}\N{\i1}Indeed, they're responsible for this mess.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I let them get the better of me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.05,0:21:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now she has to fight{\i0}\N{\i1}for a wedding she doesn't even want.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You think someone{\i0}\N{\i1}wrote a love song about that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, tell him{\i0}\N{\i1}to play the one about the trapped wife!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right, friend,{\i0}\N{\i1}time to get you out of here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.81,0:21:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[door opens]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[door closes]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Lady Featherington]{\i0}\N{\i1}I've invited Lord Rutledge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to dine with us Saturday.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:22:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have until then to muster{\i0}\N{\i1}appropriate enthusiasm for his proposal.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.70,0:22:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could have until Judgment Day{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and still not manage a smile{\i0}\N{\i1}for that wretched fate.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Lady Featherington]{\i0}\N{\i1}Despite all obstacles,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.91,0:22:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have managed to find a man{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}who will overlook{\i0}\N{\i1}your current circumstance{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.63,0:22:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and offer you some security.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should be lavishing me with gratitude,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.13,0:22:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and yet you merely sit here and sulk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.01,0:22:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.06,0:22:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this about Mr. Bridgerton?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He likes me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.27,0:22:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He'll propose to me, I am sure of it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That boy is barely out of leading strings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.07,0:22:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has two older brothers{\i0}\N{\i1}still running from the yoke.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.94,0:22:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are{\i0}\N{\i1}to cut Colin Bridgerton immediately,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.61,0:22:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or I will lock you in this room{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.07,0:22:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}till the day{\i0}\N{\i1}Lord Rutledge makes you his wife.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.24,0:22:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lady Featherington, wait.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.87,0:22:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are right. You have been kind to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I should like{\i0}\N{\i1}to repay you for that kindness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I were to marry Mr. Bridgerton,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.01,0:23:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you would be connected to what I gather{\i0}\N{\i1}is a very powerful family, indeed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.05,0:23:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Think what that could do for your girls.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.18,0:23:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Give me until Saturday.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.39,0:23:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I have not secured a proposal{\i0}\N{\i1}from Mr. Bridgerton by then,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.73,0:23:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall accept Lord Rutledge{\i0}\N{\i1}with a smile on my face.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.49,0:23:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My girl, you are{\i0}\N{\i1}six months away from motherhood,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.20,0:23:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}seven if you're lucky.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And even if a miracle were to occur,{\i0}\N{\i1}and Colin Bridgerton proposed tomorrow,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.20,0:23:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the wedding wouldn't be for weeks.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.50,0:23:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is only assuming{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.00,0:23:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we wait until the wedding night{\i0}\N{\i1}to consummate the union.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.38,0:23:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You will seduce him?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Marina] I will do what I must.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.81,0:23:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Lady Featherington] Very well.{\i0}\N{\i1}You have until Saturday. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My king.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.21,0:24:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No need for the formality, Lottie.{\i0}\N{\i1}Sit with me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.22,0:24:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How is little George?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.72,0:24:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, he is not so little anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.51,0:24:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grows plumper by the day, in fact.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.51,0:24:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am quite sure he does. [chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.73,0:24:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your subjects miss you, my dear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.98,0:24:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I miss you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.15,0:24:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm right here, Lottie.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.15,0:24:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was just remembering{\i0}\N{\i1}the bluebells in the cottage garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Ah.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Do you recall when you first saw them?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You said it was{\i0}\N{\i1}as if we were walking in the clouds.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.57,0:24:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles] You had just filled the paddock{\i0}\N{\i1}with kangaroos, of all things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.29,0:24:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Yes. [laughs]{\i0}\N{\i1}-Dreadful creatures.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-How are the gardens coming along?{\i0}\N{\i1}-Oh, they are in full bloom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.96,0:24:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After your meal, perhaps we could{\i0}\N{\i1}take a walk, like we used to do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.71,0:25:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And how is dear Emily?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.09,0:25:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you bring her to me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.63,0:25:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}George…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.72,0:25:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amelia was ill…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.14,0:25:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}several years ago.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.31,0:25:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She came to my room but a fortnight ago.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.81,0:25:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you not see her?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.73,0:25:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She is gone, George.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.36,0:25:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did you…?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.53,0:25:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have you done something?{\i0}\N{\i1}What have you done?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.41,0:25:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What has this woman done to my child?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}George…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.29,0:25:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No! What have you done?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-What have you done?{\i0}\N{\i1}-[servant] Your Majesty…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.21,0:25:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, you come back here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.71,0:25:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She has killed my child!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.54,0:25:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You bitch!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.21,0:25:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You bitch!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.84,0:25:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[exhales]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.43,0:25:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs deeply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.52,0:25:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.03,0:26:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[Rose] Miss?{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Daphne gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rose.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.82,0:26:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Is everything all right?{\i0}\N{\i1}-I cannot sleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is quite late{\i0}\N{\i1}for you to be up, too, is it not?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.33,0:26:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is much to be done.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.04,0:26:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you're nervous about the wedding,{\i0}\N{\i1}you need not worry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.46,0:26:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I assure you,{\i0}\N{\i1}I am managing everything.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.46,0:26:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-I will be ready.{\i0}\N{\i1}-I know you will.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.17,0:26:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are not who I worry about.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.68,0:26:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The duke.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.85,0:26:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Has he asked to beg off, miss?{\i0}\N{\i1}-No.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.15,0:26:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But he may wish to.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.36,0:26:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Every man entertains doubt{\i0}\N{\i1}before the day, I rather think,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.23,0:26:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it does not signify.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.24,0:26:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He will be a good husband to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.74,0:26:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A good father as well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.20,0:26:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[quivering inhale]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.58,0:26:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.75,0:26:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He cannot have children.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.33,0:27:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall not pretend to understand{\i0}\N{\i1}the extent of his physical impediment,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.63,0:27:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I imagine it is a source{\i0}\N{\i1}of great pain for the duke, indeed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.39,0:27:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have an aunt.{\i0}\N{\i1}She lives in Greenwich with her husband.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.77,0:27:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They have been married for ten years now{\i0}\N{\i1}and never blessed with children,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but they still are to each other{\i0}\N{\i1}as husband and wife.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.56,0:27:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Theirs is a happy union.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Because they love each other.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.40,0:27:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At least your aunt has that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.78,0:27:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall not keep you, Rose.{\i0}\N{\i1}You must have a hundred things to do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course, miss. Good night.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.88,0:27:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.39,0:27:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You smell bad.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.68,0:27:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Alice] Nicky! Stop pestering him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.43,0:27:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[baby coos]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Simon grunts, sniffs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.11,0:28:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why must everything be so bright?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is called "day" for a reason.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Charcoal and oil will soak up{\i0}\N{\i1}everything in your gut.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.61,0:28:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.87,0:28:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I am, in fact, to marry…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.66,0:28:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would like{\i0}\N{\i1}the both of you to be present.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.58,0:28:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"If"? He seems to believe{\i0}\N{\i1}there is a way out of this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.75,0:28:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles] We would be honored to attend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.38,0:28:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.51,0:28:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Alice] Have you told the duke{\i0}\N{\i1}about your exhibition series business?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.30,0:28:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alice…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.43,0:28:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will is seeking more investors{\i0}\N{\i1}for a series of matches.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.18,0:28:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps, Your Grace,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.81,0:28:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you and your future brother-in-law{\i0}\N{\i1}might be interested in investing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.15,0:28:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The viscount certainly owes you something{\i0}\N{\i1}after shooting at you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.86,0:28:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Alice!{\i0}\N{\i1}-What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.82,0:28:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am sure His Grace understands{\i0}\N{\i1}the basic tenets of marriage,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.86,0:28:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or at least he will.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.11,0:28:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything you know, I know.{\i0}\N{\i1}And everything I know…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.57,0:28:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, you eventually catch up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.28,0:29:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[Simon chuckles]{\i0}\N{\i1}-Pay her no mind.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.74,0:29:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's what I do. [chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.08,0:29:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Will, Alice laughing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.29,0:29:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Ah!{\i0}\N{\i1}-Right, dears, come on. Out you go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.72,0:29:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[dogs panting]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.27,0:29:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[dog barks softly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.69,0:29:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As low as you can go, Lady Danbury?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.90,0:29:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With these knees, yes, Your Majesty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.91,0:29:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Very well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.33,0:29:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let your young people come forward.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have heard a rumor{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.88,0:29:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that the special license{\i0}\N{\i1}you seek to marry has been denied.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.47,0:30:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am not quite sure{\i0}\N{\i1}what you believe {\i0}<span style="style2">I {\i0}{\i1}am to do about it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.98,0:30:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, plead your case.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.27,0:30:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your Majesty, I assure you{\i0}\N{\i1}nothing untoward has occurred.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.82,0:30:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is only that{\i0}\N{\i1}we love each other so very much.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.53,0:30:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.49,0:30:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}While I was deeply flattered{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.41,0:30:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}by the attention{\i0}\N{\i1}of your nephew, the prince,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.54,0:30:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.87,0:30:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I simply could not ignore{\i0}\N{\i1}my long-standing affection for the duke.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.25,0:30:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see, Your Majesty,{\i0}\N{\i1}it was love at first sight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.59,0:30:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was not, Your Majesty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.59,0:30:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The young lady flatters me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.56,0:30:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it was not love at first sight{\i0}\N{\i1}for either of us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.56,0:30:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There was attraction,{\i0}\N{\i1}certainly, at least on my part.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.23,0:30:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Miss Bridgerton thought me{\i0}\N{\i1}presumptuous, arrogant, insincere.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.23,0:30:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All fair, really.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.19,0:30:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I thought her a prim young lady{\i0}\N{\i1}barely out of leading strings.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not to mention{\i0}\N{\i1}the sister of my best friend,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.70,0:31:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and so romance was entirely{\i0}\N{\i1}out of the question for both of us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.78,0:31:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But in so removing it,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.04,0:31:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we found something far greater.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.46,0:31:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We found friendship.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.42,0:31:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You see, Miss Bridgerton and I have been{\i0}\N{\i1}fooling all of Mayfair for some time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have fooled them{\i0}\N{\i1}into thinking we are courting…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.72,0:31:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}when really, all along,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.05,0:31:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we simply enjoyed{\i0}\N{\i1}each other's company so much{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.97,0:31:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we could not stay away from one another.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.31,0:31:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have never been a man{\i0}\N{\i1}that much enjoyed flirting, or chatting,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.32,0:31:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or, indeed, talking at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.28,0:31:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But with Daphne…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.32,0:31:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Bridgerton…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.11,0:31:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}conversation has always been easy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.70,0:31:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her laughter brings me joy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.83,0:31:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To meet a beautiful woman is one thing,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.29,0:31:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but to meet your best friend{\i0}\N{\i1}in the most beautiful of women{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:31:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is something entirely apart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.42,0:32:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it is with my sincerest apologies,{\i0}\N{\i1}I must say it took the prince coming along{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.76,0:32:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for me to realize I did not want{\i0}\N{\i1}Miss Bridgerton to only be my friend.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.64,0:32:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted her to be my wife.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.85,0:32:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want her to be my wife.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.98,0:32:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so I plead with you…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}not to make us wait.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.95,0:32:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simon…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.41,0:32:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Queen Charlotte] You are wise…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.66,0:32:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}or perhaps unusually lucky{\i0}\N{\i1}to understand friendship{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.12,0:32:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to be the best possible foundation{\i0}\N{\i1}a marriage can have.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.17,0:32:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if that foundation should crumble{\i0}\N{\i1}as quickly as it was built.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall like to offer you the choice,{\i0}\N{\i1}Miss Bridgerton.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.80,0:32:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you wish to marry this man?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.40,0:33:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[attendees whispering]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.99,0:33:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[door opens]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.87,0:33:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dearly beloved,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.91,0:33:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we are gathered to join together{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.75,0:34:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this man and this woman in holy matrimony.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.88,0:34:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is said that marriage hath in it{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.13,0:34:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}less of beauty{\i0}\N{\i1}but more of safety than the single life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.60,0:34:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[dramatic choral music plays]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.71,0:34:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}…in the name of the Father,{\i0}\N{\i1}of the Son, and of the Holy Ghost. Amen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.51,0:34:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I now pronounce you man and wife.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.85,0:35:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[upbeat classical violin music plays]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.19,0:35:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[guests conversing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.37,0:35:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[woman 1] It was such a beautiful wedding.{\i0}\N{\i1}Thank you for having us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[woman 2] Your Grace.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.01,0:35:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose congratulations are in order.{\i0}\N{\i1}[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.55,0:35:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We being friends, after all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do hope you will remember my kindness{\i0}\N{\i1}in keeping secrets and repay me someday.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.14,0:35:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enjoy your triumph, Your Grace.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.44,0:35:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What about him?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.61,0:35:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He seems…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.32,0:35:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}pleasant.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.36,0:35:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kind eyes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.62,0:35:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A fine enough husband, I think.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.33,0:36:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pen, I neither know nor have time{\i0}\N{\i1}for any of these men.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.41,0:36:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, where is Colin?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.08,0:36:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can choose anyone but him.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.05,0:36:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He is my friend, Marina.{\i0}\N{\i1}I have known him forever.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.59,0:36:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I do not want him to be tricked{\i0}\N{\i1}and deceived into a lifelong commitment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.55,0:36:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You must not do this to a good man.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.02,0:36:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, should I perhaps{\i0}\N{\i1}entrap a bad man, then?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.48,0:36:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps you would find it acceptable{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.10,0:36:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for me to live my life with a man{\i0}\N{\i1}who treats me like a mere beast?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.82,0:36:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-No, I only mean--{\i0}\N{\i1}-What am I to do, Penelope?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.19,0:36:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will be a good wife to Colin,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.86,0:36:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and he a good husband and father…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.78,0:36:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}however young{\i0}\N{\i1}and well-liked by you he may be.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.62,0:36:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miss Thompson,{\i0}\N{\i1}you will be delighted to know{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.91,0:36:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that Lord Rutledge is no longer available.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.58,0:36:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He is engaged as of this morning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.34,0:36:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How terrible.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.38,0:36:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Best hope that whatever you have planned{\i0}\N{\i1}for Mr. Bridgerton actually works.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.55,0:36:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is your last hope.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.85,0:37:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[inaudible conversation]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.65,0:37:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh! [Penelope gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.36,0:37:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-I should--{\i0}\N{\i1}-As should I.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.29,0:37:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am beginning to feel a bit faint.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.50,0:37:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps you know{\i0}\N{\i1}of a more private place{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}where I might catch my breath?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.21,0:37:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Certainly, Miss Thompson. Please.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.47,0:37:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Marina] Hmm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.77,0:37:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[guests clamoring]{\i0}\N{\i1}-This is much more comfortable. Thank you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.81,0:37:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though it is still quite loud.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.44,0:37:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, of course.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.07,0:38:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Colin breathes deeply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.04,0:38:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-We should not be alone in here.{\i0}\N{\i1}-No, we should not.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.79,0:38:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.68,0:38:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can hardly believe I am saying this,{\i0}\N{\i1}but we cannot go further.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.06,0:38:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are a lady,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.32,0:38:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I must maintain your honor and mine,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.11,0:38:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no matter how… tempting otherwise.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.70,0:38:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Have I offended you?{\i0}\N{\i1}-No. [chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.50,0:38:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.50,0:38:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am a lady.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.79,0:38:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am unmarried.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.83,0:38:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And you…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.47,0:38:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}a gentleman.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.55,0:39:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then marry me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.14,0:39:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know we have only known each other{\i0}\N{\i1}a short while, but…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.89,0:39:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, would you want to marry me,{\i0}\N{\i1}Miss Thompson?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.61,0:39:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I would be delighted to marry you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.07,0:39:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-What are we waiting for?{\i0}\N{\i1}-My thoughts exactly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.94,0:39:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We will marry by the end of the season.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.57,0:39:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-It's a rather long engagement.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Or simply romantic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.45,0:39:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You deserve a grand wedding.{\i0}\N{\i1}Our families will need time to plan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.58,0:39:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-It will be wonderful, I promise you.{\i0}\N{\i1}-[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.29,0:39:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But let us not say anything now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.17,0:39:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is my sister's day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.92,0:39:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Of course.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.75,0:39:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.88,0:39:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles softly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.23,0:39:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your Majesty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.65,0:40:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must say, I am honored{\i0}\N{\i1}and most grateful for your presence.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.28,0:40:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I must say,{\i0}\N{\i1}I hope you made the right choice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.24,0:40:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, either way,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.49,0:40:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose you will enjoy{\i0}\N{\i1}your wedding night, at the very least.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.29,0:40:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, you certainly enjoy{\i0}\N{\i1}spreading secrets, do you not?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.29,0:40:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dear child, have you lost your wits?{\i0}\N{\i1}Everyone enjoys secrets.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.63,0:40:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Otherwise, why would{\i0}\N{\i1}Lady Whistledown's paper be so successful?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.26,0:40:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am flattered by your accusation,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.43,0:40:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it is simply not true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though, when you unmask the writer,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.06,0:40:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}do let me know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.02,0:40:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You believe Whistledown is Lady Danbury?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.40,0:40:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasps] Your Majesty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.65,0:40:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What evidence have you gathered?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.49,0:40:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You would like to know…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.49,0:40:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what evidence I have gathered{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.03,0:40:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in my investigation of Lady Whistledown?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.24,0:40:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you requiring your queen {\i0}\N{\i1}to ask again?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.41,0:40:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.66,0:40:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tell me what you know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.96,0:40:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, I believe her a widow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.30,0:41:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She obviously has the financial means…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.68,0:41:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-A most enjoyable party.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Indeed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.27,0:41:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um, Bridgerton… Um…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.98,0:41:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The other night…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.23,0:41:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What happened the other night?{\i0}\N{\i1}I do not believe anything happened at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.82,0:41:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.74,0:41:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Very well.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.28,0:41:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, dearest…{\i0}\N{\i1}I believe you know Mr. Bridgerton.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.03,0:41:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My wife, Mrs. Lucy Granville.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.87,0:41:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is a pleasure, Mr. Bridgerton.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.62,0:41:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mm.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.76,0:41:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I spoke to the duke.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.34,0:41:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That makes one of us.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.01,0:41:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He refused your dowry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.80,0:41:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this your attempt to raise my spirits?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He refused for your benefit, sister.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.27,0:41:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall put the money in trust,{\i0}\N{\i1}so you may use it how you see fit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.35,0:41:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For your children, perhaps.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.65,0:42:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Certainly, you two will have a brood{\i0}\N{\i1}large enough to put Mother's to shame.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.90,0:42:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-What? Is something wrong?{\i0}\N{\i1}-I am…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.32,0:42:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is all…{\i0}\N{\i1}I must take a moment. Excuse me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.67,0:42:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[breathing heavily]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.84,0:42:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[knocking at door]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.39,0:42:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Violet chuckles lightly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.68,0:42:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know it must be difficult{\i0}\N{\i1}to be leaving this house.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.64,0:42:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have many memories here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.52,0:42:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And you will make new ones{\i0}\N{\i1}with your husband.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.15,0:42:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, my husband.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.53,0:42:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seems so strange{\i0}\N{\i1}to finally be able to say that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.99,0:42:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose I have put this conversation off{\i0}\N{\i1}for as long as I can.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.20,0:42:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles nervously]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.79,0:43:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}On my wedding day,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.29,0:43:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I insisted Cook bring out{\i0}\N{\i1}round after round of food,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.46,0:43:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in part because I did not want{\i0}\N{\i1}the celebration to end, but…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.38,0:43:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}if I must confess,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.39,0:43:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was also quite apprehensive…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.56,0:43:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}of my wedding night.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.02,0:43:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In fact, I was quite full{\i0}\N{\i1}by the time we got to Aubrey Hall.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.39,0:43:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I certainly do not recommend that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.61,0:43:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, what do you recommend, Mama?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.53,0:43:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know you and the duke--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.86,0:43:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, whatever took place{\i0}\N{\i1}between the two of you…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.20,0:43:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You may very well{\i0}\N{\i1}know some things already.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.74,0:43:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know nothing, I assure you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.83,0:43:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, there are some things{\i0}\N{\i1}you ought to know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.96,0:43:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Some things that will happen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.29,0:43:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that involve you and your husband…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.55,0:43:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The duke, obviously.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.17,0:43:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, he… You see…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.64,0:43:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the marital act,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.84,0:43:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which, now that you are married,{\i0}\N{\i1}you may perform…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.10,0:44:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it is this difficult to discuss,{\i0}\N{\i1}how difficult must it be to perform?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.10,0:44:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is not, dearest. It is most natural.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.48,0:44:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Much in the way{\i0}\N{\i1}that rain soaks a field in autumn,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.78,0:44:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and in spring, flowers grow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.49,0:44:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[Violet grunts uncomfortably]{\i0}\N{\i1}-[Daphne inhales]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.45,0:44:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When you were younger, do you remember,{\i0}\N{\i1}we had two hounds in the country?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.92,0:44:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[chuckles] Bassets, in fact.{\i0}\N{\i1}-That is right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.71,0:44:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, no one explained it to them…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.55,0:44:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but there were puppies.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.76,0:44:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see. So…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.43,0:44:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, this act,{\i0}\N{\i1}it is performed to have children?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.05,0:44:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes! [laughs, sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.14,0:44:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.85,0:44:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}what if the duke{\i0}\N{\i1}and I cannot have children?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.23,0:44:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Does that prevent us{\i0}\N{\i1}from performing this act at all,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.61,0:44:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}from even having a wedding night at all?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.11,0:44:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dear, is this your concern?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.41,0:44:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.28,0:45:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Daphne, the two of you{\i0}\N{\i1}care for each other deeply.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.37,0:45:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When all is said and done,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.83,0:45:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}nothing else matters.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.08,0:45:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no reason to be concerned.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.08,0:45:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.79,0:45:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-I still have so many questions, Mama.{\i0}\N{\i1}-[knocking at door]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.63,0:45:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-They are bringing the carriages around.{\i0}\N{\i1}-It is time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.55,0:45:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.23,0:45:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Perhaps I can come with you.{\i0}\N{\i1}I've always wanted to live in a castle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.19,0:45:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If Daphne is going to take anyone{\i0}\N{\i1}with her, Gregory, it will be me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.94,0:45:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The two of you are staying here{\i0}\N{\i1}until our dear sister allows us a visit.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.78,0:45:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You mean {\i0}<span style="style2">if {\i0}{\i1}she allows us a visit.{\i0}\N{\i1}I'm sure you'll enjoy the peace and quiet.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.32,0:45:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am going to miss all of you terribly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.91,0:45:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.83,0:45:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.96,0:45:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have a present for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.34,0:45:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is upstairs, made of four walls{\i0}\N{\i1}and a very comfortable bed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.97,0:46:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose{\i0}\N{\i1}the light in your room is quite pleasant.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.14,0:46:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know we could not be any more different,{\i0}\N{\i1}but there is one thing we do share,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.06,0:46:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the certainty that you will make{\i0}\N{\i1}your own way in this world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.23,0:46:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am sure of it, Eloise.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.96,0:46:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Write to me as soon as you arrive.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Of course, Mama.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.13,0:46:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are going to be a wonderful duchess.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.81,0:46:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[carriage door opens]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.99,0:47:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-[carriage door closes]{\i0}\N{\i1}-[horse whinnies]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.14,0:47:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We should reach the inn before nightfall.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.97,0:47:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The inn?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.27,0:47:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Clyvedon is much too far a journey,{\i0}\N{\i1}and the roads are not safe after dusk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.90,0:47:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We need to rest{\i0}\N{\i1}before continuing on in the morning.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.19,0:47:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So we will be spending{\i0}\N{\i1}our wedding night at the inn?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.78,0:47:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.49,0:47:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should have told you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.95,0:47:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.71,0:47:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.37,0:48:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do hope everything is to your liking.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.24,0:48:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Should you require anything else at all,{\i0}\N{\i1}please let me know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.54,0:48:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, here we are.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.92,0:48:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Your room, Your Grace, is just over here.{\i0}\N{\i1}-[inhales sharply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.85,0:48:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I requested a separate room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.68,0:48:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.73,0:48:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Should I--{\i0}\N{\i1}-Yes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.94,0:48:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.52,0:49:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[panting rapidly]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.90,0:49:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We should go down to dinner.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.90,0:49:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs deeply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.40,0:49:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Daphne? I…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.40,0:49:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you not hungry?{\i0}\N{\i1}The food is excellent here, I assure you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.99,0:49:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-The last time I visited--{\i0}\N{\i1}-I do not want any dinner!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.00,0:49:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have spent the last three days{\i0}\N{\i1}wanting to be alone with you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.54,0:50:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}wanting to talk to you, wanting to know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.67,0:50:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I understand{\i0}\N{\i1}that you do not wish to see me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.51,0:50:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that you would prefer to stay{\i0}\N{\i1}in your separate room{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.97,0:50:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and endure a wordless dinner together{\i0}\N{\i1}on our wedding night, but I--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.18,0:50:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-That is not what I would prefer.{\i0}\N{\i1}-Simon--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.43,0:50:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are mistaken.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.35,0:50:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-You have avoided my presence.{\i0}\N{\i1}-In order to allow you your liberty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.15,0:50:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have said all but a few words to me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.94,0:50:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In order to keep myself{\i0}\N{\i1}from saying the wrong things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.28,0:50:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You've barely been able{\i0}\N{\i1}to look me in the eye.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.16,0:50:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I could not bear witness{\i0}\N{\i1}to the misery I have caused you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.62,0:50:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You did not…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.66,0:50:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am the one{\i0}\N{\i1}who trapped you into this marriage.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.54,0:50:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I trapped you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have spent the last three days in agony…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.05,0:50:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}unable to talk to you,{\i0}\N{\i1}unable to be alone with you,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.68,0:50:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because I knew{\i0}\N{\i1}you wanted nothing to do with me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.43,0:50:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And understandably so, after forcing you{\i0}\N{\i1}to make an unimaginable sacrifice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.48,0:50:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You wanted a life with children, a family.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.40,0:51:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You wanted a life{\i0}\N{\i1}with a man you truly knew.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.23,0:51:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You wanted a love match, and yet--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.90,0:51:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.40,0:51:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}this could not be any more different.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.62,0:51:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that what you hoped to say?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.66,0:51:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[exhales sharply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.41,0:51:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall join you for dinner momentarily.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.04,0:51:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs tremulously]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.80,0:51:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything I told the queen was true.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.51,0:51:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cannot stop thinking of you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.06,0:51:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From the mornings you ease,{\i0}\N{\i1}to the evenings you quiet,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.64,0:51:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to the dreams you inhabit…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.56,0:51:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my thoughts of you never end.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.78,0:51:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am yours, Daphne.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.49,0:51:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have always been yours.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.24,0:51:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.45,0:51:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do not understand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.70,0:52:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do not know how to be any more clear.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.37,0:52:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Do not get angry.{\i0}\N{\i1}-I am not angry. I--{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.75,0:52:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You look angry and bothered.{\i0}\N{\i1}Look at you, you are downright flushed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.09,0:52:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Yes, that is what happens.{\i0}\N{\i1}-When one is angry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.34,0:52:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When one burns for someone{\i0}\N{\i1}who does not feel the same!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.05,0:52:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Simon sighs]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.22,0:52:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.64,0:52:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}burn for me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.10,0:52:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why do you think{\i0}\N{\i1}I followed you into that garden?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.60,0:52:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why do you think I went into that garden?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.60,0:52:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you would have only{\i0}\N{\i1}looked at me this week{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.69,0:52:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for longer than two seconds,{\i0}\N{\i1}you would have seen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.11,0:52:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is you I cannot sacrifice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.83,0:52:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I burn…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.08,0:52:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.25,0:52:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[soft romantic music plays]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.26,0:52:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[both breathing passionately]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.52,0:53:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[whispering] What are you…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.94,0:53:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Simon?{\i0}\N{\i1}-Do you want me to stop?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.73,0:53:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. [gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.28,0:53:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do you want me to stop?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.45,0:53:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to show you more.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.08,0:53:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}More?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.17,0:53:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[both breathing heavily]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.73,0:53:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Daphne breathing tremulously]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.67,0:54:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[both sighing]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.63,0:54:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you touch yourself…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.84,0:55:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}like we talked about?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.35,0:55:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Show me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.35,0:55:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.39,0:55:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cannot.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.87,0:55:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[quivering sigh]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.58,0:55:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.58,0:55:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tell me what you thought about{\i0}\N{\i1}when you were alone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.79,0:55:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasping] I thought about…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.25,0:55:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[inhales sharply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.09,0:55:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Simon, I need you closer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.10,0:55:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[inhales deeply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.31,0:55:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasps]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.46,0:56:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This may hurt a moment.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.34,0:56:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Daphne gasps sharply]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.14,0:56:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Daphne grunts, moans]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.19,0:56:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasps, moans]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.99,0:56:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[soft romantic music continues]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.79,0:56:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[both gasping]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.05,0:57:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought about you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.59,0:57:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I touch myself,{\i0}\N{\i1}I always think about you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.01,0:57:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasping intensifies]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.98,0:57:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasping intensifies]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.94,0:57:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[gasping crescendos]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.41,0:57:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Daphne moans]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.12,0:57:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[both breathing heavily]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.96,0:57:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[Daphne chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.25,0:57:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How do you feel?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.38,0:57:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.80,0:57:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles] I feel…{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.09,0:57:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}wonderful.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.55,0:57:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[chuckles]{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.18,0:57:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[sighs]{\i0}
